WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:04.172
♪♪

00:00:05.063 --> 00:00:06.984
AJAK
Five years ago, Thanos erased

00:00:07.035 --> 00:00:09.574
half of the population
of the universe.

00:00:09.625 --> 00:00:13.016
But the people of this planet
brought everyone back

00:00:13.067 --> 00:00:14.810
with the snap of a finger.

00:00:16.545 --> 00:00:18.873
The sudden return
of the population...

00:00:21.029 --> 00:00:25.943
provided the necessary energy
for the emergence to begin.

00:00:26.161 --> 00:00:28.957
♪♪

00:00:29.008 --> 00:00:31.536
[Waves crashing]

00:00:33.411 --> 00:00:34.989
IKARIS
How long do we have?

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:36.328
AJAK
Seven days.

00:00:36.379 --> 00:00:41.375
♪♪

00:00:43.544 --> 00:00:44.685
SERSI
We're Eternals.

00:00:47.747 --> 00:00:49.856
We came here 7,000 years ago...

00:00:52.685 --> 00:00:54.638
to protect humans
from the Deviants.

00:00:54.911 --> 00:00:55.897
[Roar]

00:00:59.817 --> 00:01:01.533
DANE WHITMAN
Why didn't you guys help fight Thanos?

00:01:01.583 --> 00:01:04.273
Or any war? Or all the other
terrible things throughout history?

00:01:04.324 --> 00:01:06.366
♪♪

00:01:06.417 --> 00:01:07.820
SERSI
We were instructed not to interfere

00:01:07.870 --> 00:01:10.153
in any human conflicts
unless Deviants were involved.

00:01:10.838 --> 00:01:12.030
DANE WHITMAN
By who?

00:01:14.027 --> 00:01:17.096
♪♪

00:01:20.988 --> 00:01:22.492
IKARIS
We need to find the others.

00:01:22.542 --> 00:01:24.542
♪♪

00:01:25.175 --> 00:01:26.920
SERSI
I haven't seen some of them for centuries.

00:01:29.305 --> 00:01:30.250
KINGO
Hi.

00:01:30.860 --> 00:01:31.665
THENA
Hello.

00:01:32.789 --> 00:01:33.599
SPRITE
If this is what the end of

00:01:33.649 --> 00:01:34.742
the world looks like...

00:01:35.501 --> 00:01:37.097
at least we have
front-row seats.

00:01:37.954 --> 00:01:39.409
PHASTOS
You know what's never saved the planet?

00:01:39.459 --> 00:01:40.529
Your sarcasm.

00:01:42.467 --> 00:01:46.357
♪♪

00:01:47.115 --> 00:01:48.456
THENA
We have loved these people

00:01:48.506 --> 00:01:50.173
since the day we arrived.

00:01:51.803 --> 00:01:53.447
When you love something...

00:01:56.496 --> 00:01:58.025
you protect it.

00:01:58.076 --> 00:02:00.120
♪♪

00:02:10.868 --> 00:02:12.868
KRO
You can't protect...

00:02:20.561 --> 00:02:21.881
any of them.

00:02:21.932 --> 00:02:24.611
♪♪

00:02:25.811 --> 00:02:27.561
[Roar]

00:02:28.045 --> 00:02:29.045
[Grunt]

00:02:30.693 --> 00:02:34.648
♪♪

00:02:34.699 --> 00:02:36.659
IKARIS
I bet you've built the perfect safe house.

00:02:36.709 --> 00:02:38.343
And what's this even made of?
Vibranium?

00:02:38.393 --> 00:02:39.233
PHASTOS
Don't!

00:02:39.283 --> 00:02:40.617
[Objects clattering]

00:02:44.307 --> 00:02:45.624
Fall collection.

00:02:46.088 --> 00:02:46.917
IKEA.

